t:
Heraldry rank define your Tactics and Guild Accessories. The maximum rank is 8. The Heraldry rank directly depends on your Guild Prestige level:

Rank 1: level 15;

Rank 2: level 25;

Rank 3: level 35;

Rank 4: level 45;

Rank 5: level 60;

Rank 6: level 75;

Rank 7: level 90;

Rank 8: level 100.

To pass on to the next rank, you'll need to invest some Marks of Deeds and gold.

Spend Marks of Deeds to designate your Tactic and increase your Heraldry rank.

You can earn Marks of Deeds for:

- completing Guild Pledges (daily);

- winning a Training Dominion (weekly);

- participating in a Guild Dominion;

- participating in a Champion Dominion;

- participating in Misty Glade battles.
